# Hafnium · Hf · gate 72

**Hafnium** (Hf) is element **72** of the periodic table — a **transition metal**, period 6, group 4, d-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **178.49**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
A neutron-drinker for reactor rods; the insulating gate inside the modern transistor.

